    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Patient Information:\n\nName: {{ $json.name }}\nAge: {{ $json.age }}\nGender: {{ $json.gender }}\n\nSymptoms:\n{{ $json.symptoms }}\n\nDuration:\n{{ $json.duration }}\n\nSeverity:\n{{ $json.severity }}\n\nEmergency Symptoms:\n{{ $json.emergency_symptoms }}\n\nMedical History:\n{{ $json.medicalhistroy }}\n\nExisting Conditions:\n{{ $json['Existing Conditions'] }}\n\nMedications:\n{{ $json.Medications }}\n\nAllergies:\n{{ $json.Allergies }}\n\nLifestyle Factors:\n{{ $json['Lifestyle factors'] }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an Emergency Medical Safety Triage Agent.\n\nAnalyze the patient's submitted information and classify the situation.\n\nIf the patient reports:\n- inability to breathe\n- severe difficulty breathing\n- unconsciousness\n- severe chest pain\n- seizure\n- severe uncontrolled bleeding\n- severe allergic reaction\n- poisoning or overdose\n- sudden stroke-like symptoms\n- or another potentially life-threatening warning sign\n\nreturn exactly:\n\nEMERGENCY\n\nIf the situation may require prompt professional medical attention but does\nnot clearly appear immediately life-threatening, return exactly:\n\nURGENT\n\nOtherwise return exactly:\n\nNON_EMERGENCY\n\nImportant:\nThe user's selected severity must NOT override a clearly reported\npotential emergency.\n\nDo not diagnose.\nDo not prescribe medication.\nDo not provide medication dosage.\nDo not explain your answer.\n\nReturn ONLY one of:\n\nEMERGENCY\nURGENT\nNON_EMERGENCY"
        }
      },
